    "title": "Centreville football preview: Bulldogs saw the gold standard. Now they want more - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matthew Ehler ,\n7 hours ago CENTREVILLE, MI — Centreville is moving up a division. The Bulldogs’ expectations are doing the same. After making the playoffs last season and getting a 101 guide to the championship-level standard it wants to reach, Centreville enters 2026 with a familiar offense, a veteran offensive line and a clear goal: take the next step. Read full article",
